Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.34,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,That boy is so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:14.35,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Is he a model?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:16.06,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,He's got really great skin, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:18.61,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,My hotness is on point again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:21.84,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hot, both smart and athletic,\N and both beautiful and witty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:25.10,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Is there a more perfect man than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:28.01,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Of course there's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:01.76,Episode Title,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H329DED&\3c&HD5F1FB&\fad(446,1)}"Of Course, My Mom..."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:07.36,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Today's workout regimen consists of front \Nplanks, plank leg raises, and push-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.56,Main,Haruka,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome home, Maa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:13.57,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Would you act your age for once, you old hag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.95,0:02:17.13,Main,Haruka,0000,0000,0000,,Owie...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:19.82,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,How old are you?\N Would you give that up already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:26.70,Main,Haruka,0000,0000,0000,,Maa-kun, you dummy! I'm in the fifth grade!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:29.36,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Are you still half-asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:35.09,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, dear. Maa-kun, you know better \Nthan to be mean to little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:36.30,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:42.11,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You don't remember her?\N She's Asae-neesan's little Haruka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:44.76,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Aunt... Asae?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:48.60,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Haruka-chan is your cousin, Maa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.70,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Has it been about a year\N since you last saw each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:51.98,Main,Haruka,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:53.61,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Haruka?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.61,0:02:56.77,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Haruka? I've heard that name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.77,0:03:00.91,Italics Top,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah. That was right around \Nthe time I finally got skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:03:00.91,Flashback,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you all for gathering here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:05.90,Flashback,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Eat plenty, drink plenty, \Nand enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:09.33,Flashback,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:11.71,Flashback,Haruka,0000,0000,0000,,Masamune-oniichan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:15.17,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, she's that pudgy little pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:20.08,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Man, you sure do look a lot like the loli hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:23.18,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I mean... You sure have grown in a year! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.64,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:27.60,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you make Mom cry again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:29.66,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, no! She's not—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:33.14,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,She's not what? You horrible son!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:37.73,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Masamune-kun and Chinatsu-chan. \NI see you're as close as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:45.73,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.73,0:03:49.04,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could've had an older \Nbrother for Haruka, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:51.80,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You've still got time, Nee-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:55.17,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,You think so?\N Maybe I'll give it another try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.92,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be cheering you on.\N Right, Haruka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:00.16,Main,Haruka,0000,0000,0000,,You can do it, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:03.63,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Just how are you going to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:06.17,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Guess they really are sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:09.06,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, though, they all \Nlook way too much alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.53,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Is our hag some kind of monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.34,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Come over here for a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:17.30,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Chinatsu-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.85,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Here, change into these.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:34.81,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:39.44,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.14,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:47.32,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,This is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:55.34,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:58.24,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let this continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:04:59.44,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.85,0:05:04.90,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Very nice! Why don't you \Ntwo get a little closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.74,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.54,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, is she calling the cops?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:12.62,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:13.62,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:22.59,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.01,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on, now! It's your Auntie Asae!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:25.95,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,You lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:28.98,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,Please. I just got a little serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:30.98,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Serious? What does "serious" even mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:32.16,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Serious about what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.57,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Asae-neesan, you should have \NChinatsu-chan take your picture, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:37.49,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,That was exactly my intention!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:39.71,Main,Haruka,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! We all match!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:42.69,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,It's amazing what you can do with makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:45.15,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Makeup? This is makeup?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:48.75,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Does that mean our loli hag also \Nlooks like that because of makeup,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:50.04,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,and she's actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:53.79,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Women are terrifying!\N I don't even want to think about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:57.23,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan, you dummy. Mom is all natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:58.38,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:00.25,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:03.18,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,That's terrifying in its own right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:13.26,Main,All,0000,0000,0000,,So, which one is your real mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:16.00,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Is it me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:17.30,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,It's me, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:18.60,Main,Haruka,0000,0000,0000,,It's me, duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:20.64,Main,One,0000,0000,0000,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:21.76,Main,Two,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Maa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:23.48,Main,Three,0000,0000,0000,,I'm telling you, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:23.48,Main,Some,0000,0000,0000,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.11,0:06:26.48,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.63,0:06:32.11,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:39.78,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Um... You see, Maa-kun, \NI wanted to be your girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:41.84,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,so I tried really hard to grow bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:42.58,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.31,Main,Asae,0000,0000,0000,,Cousins can get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:49.20,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,You've got good taste. I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:51.62,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,But someone else already has my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.30,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.49,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Whoops... I was a bit too straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:01.77,Main,Haru,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if things don't work out,\N I get to be next, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:02.76,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:07.13,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,The women of the Makabe \Nfamily sure are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.29,Main,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,You're the last person who should say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:18.16,Episode Title,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(363,1)}"Tsunade Island, Once More."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.92,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,This feels great, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:24.88,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,The scent of the salt air is so rich\N that it's almost suffocating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:28.03,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think I'd be able \Nto come back this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:32.47,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,We must thank Aki-sama\N for inviting us over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:35.82,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I'm sure it'll be a lot of fun again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:38.10,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be there soon, so get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:39.31,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:43.81,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to Tsunade Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:46.19,sign_11481_110_Tsunade_Island,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Tsunade Island
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:46.19,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,We're happy to have you again this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:48.84,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Yuisaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:52.16,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see you're as cute as ever, cutie boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:54.22,Main,Koju,0000,0000,0000,,"Cutie boy"...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:57.34,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to Aki-sama and the rest, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:07:58.35,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:02.16,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I may be "the rest,"\N but thank you for having us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:05.17,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Where's the fucking \Nrefreshing boy from last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:07.63,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:08.91,Italics,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:11.23,Italics,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Did they break up? Separate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.23,0:08:13.63,Italics,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye my love? \NSomething definitely happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:15.09,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:17.30,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Get a hold of yourself, Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:21.24,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,There are plenty of good men \Nother than that fucking boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:24.66,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Now, hit me with any venting or anything \Nawful you want to say about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:26.32,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:28.72,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,It really is too bad about Masamune-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.45,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,If only {\i1}that{\i0} hadn't happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.45,0:08:31.33,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,"That"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:33.50,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Was the reason infidelity? DV?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:34.70,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.51,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my stars! My, oh, my, oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:39.53,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Who did he cheat with? Who did he hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.53,0:08:41.66,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Himself... and himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:42.41,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:46.83,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,He's such an idiot.\N He's the worst idiot who ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.64,Flashback Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on top of my game again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:52.72,Flashback Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Everything about me is in perfect symmetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:55.33,Flashback Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I look beautiful walking or sitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:59.06,Flashback Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Not to mention my hotness \Nis blinding as the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.04,Flashback Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,I am truly perfec—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:04.76,Flashback,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:10.03,Main,aki,0000,0000,0000,,He was so enamored by his reflection \Nthat he crashed into a street lamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:12.07,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,He actually bled? And got a concussion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:14.56,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,How self-loving and narcissistic can he be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.91,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,He is the biggest fool who's ever lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:20.43,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, so that's why he \Ncouldn't come on this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:22.00,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:28.65,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,I mean... Oh, I hope he \Ngets back on his feet soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:32.44,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What? As if I want anything to do with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:35.78,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, I'll gladly \Ntake him off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:37.10,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:40.36,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You two can't even tell when I'm joking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.29,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I thought you were quite serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:47.95,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Just try on this \Nbikini for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:50.57,Main,Koju,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:57.55,Main,Koju,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe-kun, how could you \Nleave me alone like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:03.60,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sure he'd look cute in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:04.78,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:07.61,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,It's not as if I don't understand how you feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:10.38,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.19,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you two ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:14.01,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.87,0:10:20.34,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:23.02,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, what happened?\N Did you finally hit puberty?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:26.06,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I'm not my old self anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:35.55,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's such a nice day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:39.42,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,T-Today is quite amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:42.43,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Something came rolling toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:52.20,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:54.06,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Aki-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:57.48,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry. Could you bring \Nme something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:11:00.92,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Please prepare your own meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:06.62,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshino's gotten quite a bit bolder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:44.92,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshi—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:47.26,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:49.00,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:50.72,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.53,0:12:00.68,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,You should start brushing from the ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:05.02,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:06.42,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for having us over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:07.03,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:11.28,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "what?" \NWe're having a girls' night!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:13.54,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Talking into the wee hours \Nof the morning is a must!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:16.24,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,We came all the way to the ocean!\N And it's nighttime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:17.41,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:20.86,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,This calls for sweets\N and relationship stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:24.56,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Relationship stories! \NAnd things like what our types are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.05,0:12:29.28,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Setting that aside...\N Maybe we should talk about some troubles
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.68,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,we can finally bring up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:36.56,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What? I'm fine with talking about \Nrelationship things or any advice you'd need!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:40.54,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Since we're all here, we should...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.54,0:12:41.86,Main,All,0000,0000,0000,,We should...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:42.97,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Study.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:46.56,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:48.21,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,That'd be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:49.28,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.80,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You were actually serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:58.09,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, we're third-years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:13:00.40,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,We have to prepare for entrance exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:02.00,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's start with kanji drills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:03.05,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:06.34,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,There isn't enough alcohol, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:09.90,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,What are y'all being so buddy-buddy for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.90,0:13:11.52,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:14.98,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't be considered a girl anymore \Nbecause I've bazongaed into my thirties?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.78,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,This old hag is trying way too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.78,0:13:20.00,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Asking for a ring for my birthday \Npresent was too overbearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.76,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,A beef bowl is more than enough?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:22.67,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Help...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:25.11,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Shut your dumbass mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:28.10,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:31.01,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Love is just an illusion. \NIt's all a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:34.33,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Some people just wake up from \Nthe dream faster than others!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:38.04,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Aki! Sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:40.00,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:43.71,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,You only went out with that \Nhot boy because he's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:45.51,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,You wouldn't have done it if he were a fatty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:48.82,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,How about you? Would you date a fatty?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:51.14,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Er, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:53.94,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I'd have no issue as long as they were healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:55.74,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I'd still go out with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.68,0:13:57.48,Main,both,0000,0000,0000,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:14:00.03,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You averted your eyes just now, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:03.02,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,You only like attractive people, \Ndon't you?! You terrifying child!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:09.78,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I'd love to hear what you'd have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:10.91,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:16.12,Main,Midori,0000,0000,0000,,You terrifying child!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:22.84,Main,Koju,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe-kun, save me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:55.69,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:57.33,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,So, how are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:58.96,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.16,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,How are things over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:03.59,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. We're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.91,0:15:06.02,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not as though I have to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.02,0:15:09.30,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,how you're holding up,\N or if you'll run into another pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:12.51,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,It's a very nice feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:15.71,Italics,Masa,0000,0000,0000,,So you're lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:25.04,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I'm lonely, you dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:32.70,Episode Title,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(442,431)}"Cinderella After Twelve"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.55,0:15:38.16,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:41.32,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Here. Gifts from Tsunade Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:45.81,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right. Thanks. Did you have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.81,0:15:47.05,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:50.86,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Don't you have the day off today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:53.55,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Your trip to Tsunade Island\N counted as work, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:58.60,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, I can understand that you feel \Nmore comfortable wearing that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.27,0:16:10.16,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Pick whatever you like and try it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:10.97,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:21.31,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,This is way too mature for me.\N It won't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:22.62,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.91,0:16:25.58,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,We're sisters. Of course it'll look good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:36.76,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:38.65,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Not quite right, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:42.52,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:46.96,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Onee-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.01,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:53.40,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Stay perfectly still. \NOtherwise, you'll see blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:22.02,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,We should probably trim your bangs a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.56,0:17:32.49,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:39.88,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:45.21,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:50.29,Italics,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:53.21,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,And you're all done.\N You can open your eyes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:05.07,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,I guess we can't do much about you \Nlooking like an errand girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:09.42,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,but today's your day off,\N so go do something for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:10.36,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:11.93,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:27.65,Italics,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Since I was always doing whatever \NAki-sama needed me to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.65,0:18:30.46,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,I never got to carry a tiny purse like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:36.42,Italics,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,I always wore flat shoes so that\NI could rush to her side at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:40.39,Italics,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,I never did my nails, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:50.70,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:09.51,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:11.40,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Is it to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.04,0:19:22.33,Italics,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why I can't find this fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:28.18,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:28.98,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,That was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:30.88,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, how fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:32.17,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:33.09,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.82,0:19:35.28,Italics,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:37.73,Italics,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Because when I finally let myself be selfish,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:41.10,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,I still wasn't able to get \Nthe one thing that I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:19:57.13,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Balloons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:58.89,Main,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get you one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:04.26,Main,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:16.94,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:20.28,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:38.62,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:04.18,Main,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see her? She was super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.15,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.57,0:21:06.96,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.51,0:21:13.37,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:17.17,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, but are you sure you \Nwant to come back already?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:17.93,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:21.84,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, what am I going to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:24.33,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,But it was a little bit fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:29.23,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,I had been wanting to be \Nprettier... on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.23,0:21:30.45,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:31.18,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:33.06,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,So you're finally getting serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:36.77,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll become prettier, be a better woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:38.21,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, yup...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:40.62,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,...make them fall for me, and then dump them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:41.32,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:44.49,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:49.67,Main,Yoshi,0000,0000,0000,,It's Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.68,0:21:57.62,Main,Nari,0000,0000,0000,,Who knew she had that side to her?
